explanation = <p>Runs curated SPL from this app with app-owned index scoping and only the required exported source knowledge objects. Dashboard-only filters are neutralized so the search runs independently. The span-free <code>timechart</code> preserves Splunk's automatic time-bucket selection and splits the metric by <code>user</code>.</p>
solution = <p>Review unexpected identities, failures, source systems, and timing against approved administrative activity.</p>
related_info = <ul><li><b>Provenance</b><br><code>cisco_dc_networking_app_for_splunk</code> / <code>auditing.xml</code>.</li></ul>
